<div class="entry-content single-content">
	
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">How many boxes do you need to move? This free <strong>moving box calculator</strong> estimates how many small, medium, large, wardrobe and dish boxes your home needs, room by room, plus the packing tape and paper to buy.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Pick your home size, change the rooms to match yours and say how much stuff you own. A typical two-bedroom apartment is filled in, and the box list updates as you type, so you can copy it or print it before you shop.</p>



<div id="dsh-boxes" class="dsh-calc">

